{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10213","headline":"与从弟正字从兄兵曹宴集林园 · 李嘉佑","name":"与从弟正字从兄兵曹宴集林园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹窓松户有佳期，美酒香茶慰所思。\n辅嗣外生还解易，惠连羣从总能诗。\n檐前花落春深後，谷里莺啼日暮时。\n去路归程仍待月，垂缰不控马行迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}